Third-party code used by this project
=====================================

Touchable — https://github.com/MZhao-ouo/Touchable
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 mzhao.
  Vendored under Touchable/ (game adaptation layers, internal tooling).
  This repository carries modifications for an Android host.

d2r-mobile — https://github.com/jhaizhou-ops/d2r-mobile
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 jhaizhou.
  Not vendored; scripts/setup.ps1 fetches the pinned commit and applies
  patches/d2r-mobile-android.patch (Android platform layer + Vulkan backend
  changes for this port).

Module rewriting uses the generic Switch NSO rewriter shipped inside the d2r-mobile
dependency (dm/tools/patch_nso.py, MIT); scripts/prepare-modules.ps1 drives it with
DM_TARGET=android. No rewriter code is vendored in this repository.

dmsh_xlate / Ryujinx shader tooling (inside d2r-mobile) is used to translate the
game's shaders to SPIR-V; see its own LICENSE files under dm/third_party.

No game content is included in this repository: no RomFS data, no module
binaries, no keys, no screenshots of copyrighted artwork.
